{"availability":"available","full":"foxhound87/mobx-formkit","name":"mobx-formkit","description":"Reactive MobX Form State Management","category":"Other","language":"TypeScript","stars":1094,"forks":131,"created":"2016-06-20T22:10:41Z","updated":"2026-08-18T14:58:45Z","license":"MIT","branch":"master","homepage":"https://foxhound87.github.io/mobx-formkit","topics":["form","mobx","observables","reactive","state","validation"],"demo":"https://foxhound87.github.io/mobx-formkit-demo","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-05T21:32:31.064Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-05T21:32:31.064Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-05T21:32:31.064Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-05T21:32:31.064Z","stars":1094,"forks":131}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Reactive MobX Form State Management — extensible validation, nested fields, event hooks, and bindings for any UI framework, with full TypeScript support.","Documentation &bull; Quick Start &bull; Live Demo &bull; Demo Code &bull; NPM &bull; AI Skills &bull; Discord","MobX Formkit is a form state management library built on MobX observables. The core is UI-agnostic — it depends only on mobx and renders in React, Vue 3, Lit, Angular, Solid, or vanilla JS through the matching MobX binding. Define your fields declaratively and get reactivity, validation, change tracking, and component bindings automatically."],"features":["8 Validation Plugins — DVR, VJF, AJV, YUP, JOI, ZOD, VALIBOT & VINEJS: sync & async, extendable, and mixable on the same form.","Nested Fields & Arrays — deeply nested field structures with dot notation, dynamic add/remove/move, ordered ArrayMap collections, and full serialization.","Event Hooks & Handlers — full lifecycle control: onInit, onChange, onFocus, onBlur, onSubmit, onSuccess, onError & more.","UI-Agnostic Core — the same Form instance renders in React, Vue 3, Lit, Angular, Solid, Octane, or vanilla JS with a MobX binding.","Field Props Bindings — one-line bind() for standard inputs, plus custom rewriters & templates for Material UI, Ant Design, React Aria, Headless UI, React Widgets, React Select, Chakra UI, PrimeReact & more."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/foxhound87/mobx-formkit/blob/master/README.md","fingerprint":"896f0e6a81eebbb144c129a423e402fb7a095ca39d6eb2a3e794f8d698aa9e49","extractedAt":"2026-10-05T21:32:31.166Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-05T21:32:31.166Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Reactive MobX Form State Management — extensible validation, nested fields, event hooks, and bindings for any UI framework, with full TypeScript support.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/foxhound87/mobx-formkit/blob/master/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"896f0e6a81eebbb144c129a423e402fb7a095ca39d6eb2a3e794f8d698aa9e49","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/foxhound87/mobx-formkit/blob/master/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-05T21:32:31.166Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-08-18T14:58:45Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/foxhound87/mobx-formkit/blob/master/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-05T21:32:31.167Z","hash":"896f0e6a81eebbb144c129a423e402fb7a095ca39d6eb2a3e794f8d698aa9e49","originalBytes":11973,"storedBytes":11973,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["middot","form","npm","fields","mobx","password","validation","react","bindings","bull","downloads","email","hooks","dvr","field","full","import","legacy","mobx-react-form","quick","run","setup","const","documentation","event","label","mobx-formkit","nested","package","plugins","props","start","api","demo","devtools","form.","formkit","forms","get","guide","issues","mrf","name","new","placeholder","required","rules","same","skills","state","string","submit","tests","typescript","validatorjs","actions","add","agent","alert","angular","any","backers","bash","between","binding.","changes","class-based","code","commit","composer","computed","core","custom","default","dependencies","error","handle